{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんおはよ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、小さい女の子が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「パピプペポパピプペポっ\nパペプパペプパペプっ...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いながら歩いてて、\n私は心の中でなんか\nポピパッパパーみたいだなぁ\nと密かに思ってたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ポピパッパパーポピパッパパー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と女の子が歌い始めて\nびっくりしました(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもちゃんと言えてるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんサビ以外は難しくて\n歌えなかったのかなと思ったら\nすごく微笑ましかった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして別の日、\n小学校低学年くらいの少年2人が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A君「お前サンタクロースに何頼むか決めた？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B君「俺もう頼んだぜっ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A君「え！早くね？！何頼んだの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B君「ないしょー。早く頼んだ方がイイのもらえるんだよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A君「まじかよっ！じゃあ今日おねがいしよーっと！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という会話を電車の中で\n繰り広げていて、\nなんて可愛らしいんだろうと\nマスクの下で微笑みながら\n聞いてました(*^^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさん  じゃなくて\nサンタクロース  って\n言ってるとこも、きっと\n幼いなりにかっこつけてるん\nだろうなぁと思うと可愛い(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平和な会話だ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/29/4874344/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウインク パチリッ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/29/4874344/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔でもヘニャンって口角が\n上がってるのでよく真顔をしてても\nまだ顔笑ってるよ！って\n言われる口してるらしい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張で個別握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アノ子があんなことを\n提案してきたので\nあんなことしますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとパッと見では\n気づく人はなかなかいないと\n思うんだけどね(人-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部の部ではないけど\n何部でやるかはあとで\nアノ子と決めます\\( ^^)/♡\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、髪の毛を5cm切りました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってもロングの人の\n5cmは周りから見たら\nほとんどわからないと思うけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\nこの前はお仕事のあとに\n玲香と若月とご飯に\n行ってきたよ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香かわいいし\n若月もかわいいし\nもちろん私も〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って最後のは冗談ですが\n2人とも忙しいし時間ない中\n私が元気なかったりすると\n一緒に行ってくれて\n本当に優しい2人です(ノω・、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会来てくれる方\n第5レーンで待ってます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寝坊さんはダメだぞ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに見られて〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/29/4874344/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひゃーんっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/29/4874344/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさとちゅっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/11/29/4874344/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまとちゅっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は、またいつか///♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌などの告知は次の\nブログでさせてもらいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあね〜(∩^ω^∩)"}],"source":"archive"}